# Rendered page images and raw per-engine transcripts.
#
# Excluded for two reasons, and the second is the one that matters: they are
# page images of copyrighted books from a local corpus, and a benchmark report
# is no reason to put someone else's book in a git repository — least of all
# one that gets mirrored publicly. They are also regenerated by any run.
#
# The reports, the tables and the plots stay: those are measurements, and the
# short quoted lines in them are fair comment on extraction quality.
snapshots/
*/snapshots/
